{"2492290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Uncover the Smoking Gun", "steam_appid": 2492290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3128260], "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Questions, Doubts... Truth!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What if robots gained free will? Would they still exist for humanity's sake?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2030, a world where robots and humans coexist faces a chilling series of murders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prime suspects? Robots living among us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the scattered evidence at crime scenes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and navigate through the web of truth and deception in the robots' testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/0dff1508227a62746ae50bf8511fd5fb.avif?t=1760355284\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># No Choices, Only Questions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your questions are the keys to unraveling the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All victims are linked to an experiment called &quot;Project Atlas.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subject X, Atlas Chip, and H.R.P.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What massive truth is hidden behind this chain of events?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/9488347a270d1e8083056904467feb5d.poster.avif?t=1760355284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/9488347a270d1e8083056904467feb5d.webm?t=1760355284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/9488347a270d1e8083056904467feb5d.mp4?t=1760355284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience 5 gripping episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engage in deep conversations with case-related robots to uncover the incident's full story and crucial clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If the suspect robot is the culprit, trigger system overload questions to switch them to confession mode, revealing the incident's truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover hidden stories by finding all evidence and confirming the case's truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Utilize the investigation status board actively to ensure you don't miss any vital clues or decisive questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/5a428cbcada4b01b21474d2b8557d40e.poster.avif?t=1760355284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/5a428cbcada4b01b21474d2b8557d40e.webm?t=1760355284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/extras/5a428cbcada4b01b21474d2b8557d40e.mp4?t=1760355284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A Battle of Wits with AI: Solve the case by conversing with a suspect robot using GPT to gather evidence. What single truth emerges from countless dialogues and pieces of information?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A fun, low-stress game with a realistic art style, where AI-driven crime scenes fit perfectly with the quirky characters.”<br>86 – Impulse Gamer<br><br>“Setting a new standard in usage of AI in gaming.”<br>80 – Inven<br><br>“Really interesting and original gameplay mechanics and can be really fun. The handful of issues that exist aren’t too big, and although not cheap, the price is more than fair for what the game does.”<br>85 – Game Grin<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/header.jpg?t=1760355284", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/92ffe1f33a785bf49c1e203796d6f29f32389980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760355284", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492290/92ffe1f33a785bf49c1e203796d6f29f32389980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760355284", "website": "https://www.relugames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050/ AMD RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2023 ReLU Games, Inc.